        "benchmark_ref": "Abualigah, L., Diabat, A., Mirjalili, S., Abd Elaziz, M., & Gandomi, A. H. (2021). The Arithmetic Optimization Algorithm. Computer Methods in Applied Mechanics and Engineering, 376, 113609.",
        "usage": "$env:PSO_EXPERIMENTS_CONFIG = '.\\config\\experiments_mdpi_smoke.json'; python 0_0_reiniciar.py; python 1_0_poblarDB.py; python 2_main.py",
